    "turn_text": "i think that's right and and this more than Almost any other time I can think of is a real crisis for the Republican Party. You certainly have a lot of distrust between the establishment and the more conservative wings. We saw that, of course. That's what caused this with McCarthy. And there's one other theory on the whole McCarthy thing we can talk about briefly. That these warring factions are just essentially ungovernable right now",
